     "approx": true,
     "note": "At the top of Flute Bowl. Get to Flute from the Symphony, Harmony 6 or Peak Express, then skin or bootpack up Flute Summit (about 15 minutes). Leads into Garibaldi Provincial Park: the Musical Bumps, Oboe and Singing Pass."
    },
    {
     "id": "bcglacier",
     "name": "Garibaldi Park gate (Blackcomb Glacier)",
     "side": "Blackcomb",
     "lat": 50.086,
     "lon": -122.8697,
     "approx": true,
     "note": "On the Blackcomb Glacier, entered from the top of the Showcase T-Bar (experts also come in from Spanky's Ladder). Leads to the East Col and the Spearhead Range. Whistler Blackcomb asks you to recheck the East Col's status the morning of your trip and again just before you go."
    },
    {
     "id": "seventh",
     "name": "Backcountry gate by 7th Heaven",
     "side": "Blackcomb",
     "lat": 50.0786,
     "lon": -122.8866,
     "approx": true,
     "note": "Marked on the resort's trail map beside Cloud Nine and Panorama, near the bottom of 7th Heaven. Where Body Bag Bowl and DOA come back into the ski area, and where tours up Disease Ridge start."
